{"completed": true, "response": "这份亲近开始让他感到踏实、温暖和满足，原本的警惕也因此暂时放松了些，他比一开始更愿意流露自己的心意。正因为这份温暖很珍贵，他在感到满足的同时，也有些舍不得，希望这种舒服的感觉能够一直持续下去。他的心意一度变得更热切，但很快又慢慢收了回来：越是从亲近中感到满足，他就越在意自己投入了多少，也仍然担心，表露心意会改变这份亲近原本的意义。所以，他此刻的开心和温暖都是真实的，只是心里仍有保留，对未来的期待也还没有完全安定下来。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "226f8d5f-68d3-477b-a9da-b82ba3d46491", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004021018696Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.812, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:40:28.824354+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "19b643985932b23a431cf017d71ee39cb0de42943914eb7c7d1d72e2906d2435", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004021018696Z", "files": 